risk and may elect to give credit or special thanks to any such contributors in the attached copyright notice. However, if any of Your contributions are included into the Software, they will become part of the Software and will be distributed under the terms and conditions of this License. Further, if Your donated Contributions are integrated into the Software then Sony Computer Entertainment, Inc. shall become the copyright owner of the Software now containing Your contributions and SCEA would be the Licensor.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"5.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Redistribution in Source Form\n\n   You may redistribute copies of the Software, modifications or derivatives thereof in Source Code Form, provided that You:\n\n      <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"a.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Include a copy of this License and any copyright notices with source\n\n      <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"b.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Identify modifications if any were made to the Software\n\n      <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"c.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Include a copy of all documentation accompanying the Software and modifications made by You\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"6.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Redistribution in Object Form\n\n   If You redistribute copies of the Software, modifications or derivatives thereof in Object Form only (as incorporated into finished goods, i.e. end user applications) then You will not have a duty to include any copies of the code, this License, copyright notices, other attributions or documentation.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"7.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> No Warranty\n\n   THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED ON AN \"AS IS\" BASIS, WITHOUT ANY REPRESENTATIONS OR WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING, WITHOUT LIMITATION, ANY WARRANTIES OF TITLE, NON-INFRINGEMENT, MERCHANTABILITY, OR FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. YOU ARE SOLELY RESPONSIBLE FOR DETERMINING THE APPROPRIATENESS OF USING, MODIFYING OR REDISTRIBUTING THE SOFTWARE AND ASSUME ANY RISKS ASSOCIATED WITH YOUR EXERCISE OF PERMISSIONS UNDER THIS LICENSE.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"8.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Limitation of Liability\n\n   UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES AND UNDER NO LEGAL THEORY WILL EITHER PARTY BE LIABLE TO THE OTHER PARTY OR ANY THIRD PARTY FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, CONSEQUENTIAL, SPECIAL, INCIDENTAL, OR EXEMPLARY DAMAGES WITH RESPECT TO ANY INJURY, LOSS, OR DAMAGE, ARISING UNDER OR IN CONNECTION WITH THIS LETTER AGREEMENT, WHETHER FORESEEABLE OR UNFORESEEABLE, EVEN IF SUCH PARTY HAS BEEN ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH INJURY, LOSS, OR DAMAGE. THE LIMITATIONS OF LIABILITY SET FORTH IN THIS SECTION SHALL APPLY TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMISSIBLE AT LAW OR ANY GOVERMENTAL REGULATIONS.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"9.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Governing Law and Consent to Jurisdiction\n\n   This Agreement shall be governed by and interpreted in accordance with the laws of the State of California, excluding that body of law related to choice of laws, and of the United States of America. Any action or proceeding brought to enforce the terms of this Agreement or to adjudicate any dispute arising hereunder shall be brought in the Superior Court of the County of San Mateo, State of California or the United States District Court for the Northern District of California. Each of the parties hereby submits itself to the exclusive jurisdiction and venue of such courts for purposes of any such action. In addition, each party hereby waives the right to a jury trial in any action or proceeding related to this Agreement.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"10.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Copyright Notice for Redistribution of Source Code\n\nCopyright <<var;name=\"copyright\";original=\"2005 Sony Computer Entertainment Inc.\";match=\".+\">>\n\nLicensed under the SCEA Shared Source License, Version 1.0 (the \"License\"); you may not use this file except in compliance with the License. You may obtain a copy of the License at:\n\nhttp://research.scea.com/scea_shared_source_license.html\n\nUnless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software distributed under the License is distributed on an \"AS IS\" BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied. See the License for the specific language governing permissions and limitations under the License.', 'SCEA Shared Source License 1.0\n\nTerms and Conditions:\n\n1. Definitions:\n\n\"Software\" shall mean the software and related documentation, whether in Source or Object Form, made available under this SCEA Shared Source license (\"License\"), that is indicated by a copyright notice file included in the source files or attached or accompanying the source files.\n\n\"Licensor\" shall mean Sony Computer Entertainment America, Inc. (herein \"SCEA\")\n\n\"Object Code\" or \"Object Form\" shall mean any form that results from translation or transformation of Source Code, including but not limited to compiled object code or conversions to other forms intended for machine execution.\n\"Source Code\" or \"Source Form\" shall have the plain meaning generally accepted in the software industry, including but not limited to software source code, documentation source, header and configuration files.\n\n\"You\" or \"Your\" shall mean you as an individual or as a company, or whichever form under which you are exercising rights under this License.\n\n2. License Grant.\n\nLicensor hereby grants to You, free of charge subject to the terms and conditions of this License, an irrevocable, non-exclusive, worldwide, perpetual, and royalty-free license to use, modify, reproduce, distribute, publicly perform or display the Software in Object or Source Form .\n\n3. No Right to File for Patent.\nIn exchange for the rights that are granted to You free of charge under this License, You agree that You will not file for any patent application, seek copyright protection or take any other action that might otherwise impair the ownership rights in and to the Software that may belong to SCEA or any of the other contributors/authors of the Software.\n\n4. Contributions.\n\nSCEA welcomes contributions in form of modifications, optimizations, tools or documentation designed to improve or expand the performance and scope of the Software (collectively \"Contributions\"). Per the terms of this License You are free to modify the Software and those modifications would belong to You. You may however wish to donate Your Contributions to SCEA for consideration for inclusion into the Software. For the avoidance of doubt, if You elect to send Your Contributions to SCEA, You are doing so voluntarily and are giving the Contributions to SCEA and its parent company Sony Computer Entertainment, Inc., free of charge, to use, modify or distribute in any form or in any manner. SCEA acknowledges that if You make a donation of Your Contributions to SCEA, such Contributions shall not exclusively belong to SCEA or its parent company and such donation shall not be to Your exclusion. SCEA, in its sole discretion, shall determine whether or not to include Your donated Contributions into the Software, in whole, in part, or as modified by SCEA. Should SCEA elect to include any such Contributions into the Software, it shall do so at its own risk and may elect to give credit or special thanks to any such contributors in the attached copyright notice. However, if any of Your contributions are included into the Software, they will become part of the Software and will be distributed under the terms and conditions of this License. Further, if Your donated Contributions are integrated into the Software then Sony Computer Entertainment, Inc. shall become the copyright owner of the Software now containing Your contributions and SCEA would be the Licensor.\n\n5. Redistribution in Source Form\n\nYou may redistribute copies of the Software, modifications or derivatives thereof in Source Code Form, provided that You:\n\n     a. Include a copy of this License and any copyright notices with source\n\n     b. Identify modifications if any were made to the Software\n\n     c. Include a copy of all documentation accompanying the Software and modifications made by You\n\n6. Redistribution in Object Form\n\nIf You redistribute copies of the Software, modifications or derivatives thereof in Object Form only (as incorporated into finished goods, i.e. end user applications) then You will not have a duty to include any copies of the code, this License, copyright notices, other attributions or documentation.\n\n7. No Warranty\n\nTHE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED ON AN \"AS IS\" BASIS, WITHOUT ANY REPRESENTATIONS OR WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING, WITHOUT LIMITATION, ANY WARRANTIES OF TITLE, NON-INFRINGEMENT, MERCHANTABILITY, OR FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. YOU ARE SOLELY RESPONSIBLE FOR DETERMINING THE APPROPRIATENESS OF USING, MODIFYING OR REDISTRIBUTING THE SOFTWARE AND ASSUME ANY RISKS ASSOCIATED WITH YOUR EXERCISE OF PERMISSIONS UNDER THIS LICENSE.\n\n8. Limitation of Liability\n\nUNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES AND UNDER NO LEGAL THEORY WILL EITHER PARTY BE LIABLE TO THE OTHER PARTY OR ANY THIRD PARTY FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, CONSEQUENTIAL, SPECIAL, INCIDENTAL, OR EXEMPLARY DAMAGES WITH RESPECT TO ANY INJURY, LOSS, OR DAMAGE, ARISING UNDER OR IN CONNECTION WITH THIS LETTER AGREEMENT, WHETHER FORESEEABLE OR UNFORESEEABLE, EVEN IF SUCH PARTY HAS BEEN ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH INJURY, LOSS, OR DAMAGE. THE LIMITATIONS OF LIABILITY SET FORTH IN THIS SECTION SHALL APPLY TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMISSIBLE AT LAW OR ANY GOVERMENTAL REGULATIONS.\n\n9. Governing Law and Consent to Jurisdiction\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by and interpreted in accordance with the laws of the State of California, excluding that body of law related to choice of laws, and of the United States of America. Any action or proceeding brought to enforce the terms of this Agreement or to adjudicate any dispute arising hereunder shall be brought in the Superior Court of the County of San Mateo, State of California or the United States District Court for the Northern District of California. Each of the parties hereby submits itself to the exclusive jurisdiction and venue of such courts for purposes of any such action. In addition, each party hereby waives the right to a jury trial in any action or proceeding related to this Agreement.\n\n10. Copyright Notice for Redistribution of Source Code\n\nCopyright 2005 Sony Computer Entertainment Inc.\n\nLicensed under the SCEA Shared Source License, Version 1.0 (the \"License\"); you may not use this file except in compliance with the License. You may obtain a copy of the License at:\nhttp://research.scea.com/scea_shared_source_license.html\n\nUnless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software distributed under the License is distributed on an \"AS IS\" BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied. See the License for the specific language governing permissions and limitations under the License.', 'SCEA共享源许可证1.0\n\n条款和条件：\n\n1.定义：\n\n“软件”是指根据本“SCEA共享源代码许可证”(“许可证”)提供的软件和相关文档，无论是源代码形式还是对象形式，由源代码文件中包含的版权声明文件或源文件所附或随附的版权声明文件表示。\n\n“许可方”是指索尼计算机娱乐美国公司(以下简称“SCEA”)。\n\n“目标代码”或“目标形式”是指翻译或转换源代码所产生的任何形式，包括但不限于编译后的目标代码或转换为机器执行的其他形式。\n“源代码”或“源代码形式”应具有软件行业普遍接受的简单含义，包括但不限于软件源代码、文档源、头文件和配置文件。\n\n“您”或“您的”是指您作为个人或公司，或您在本许可证下行使权利的任何形式。\n\n2.许可证授予。\n\n许可方特此向您授予不可撤销的、非排他性的、全球范围内的、永久的、免版税的许可，在符合本许可证条款和条件的前提下，以对象或源代码形式使用、修改、复制、分发、公开执行或显示软件。\n\n3.无权申请专利。\n作为根据本许可证免费授予您的权利的交换，您同意您不会申请任何专利申请、寻求版权保护或采取任何其他行动，否则可能会损害属于SCEA或软件的任何其他贡献者/作者的软件的所有权。\n\n4.贡献。\n\nSCEA欢迎旨在改进或扩大软件性能和范围的修改、优化、工具或文档形式的贡献(统称为“贡献”)。根据本许可证的条款，您可以自由修改软件和那些模式通知将属于你。但是，您可能希望将您的贡献捐赠给SCEA，以考虑将其包含在软件中。为免生疑问，如果您选择将您的投稿发送给SCEA，则您是自愿这样做的，并且将投稿免费提供给SCEA及其母公司Sony Computer Entertainment，Inc.，以任何形式或以任何方式使用、修改或分发。SCEA承认，如果您将您对SCEA的贡献捐赠给SCEA，则此类捐赠不应完全属于SCEA或其母公司，并且此类捐赠不应被您排除在外。SCEA应自行决定是否将您捐赠的内容全部、部分或经SCEA修改后包含在软件中。如果SCEA选择将任何此类贡献纳入软件，则其风险自负，并可在所附版权通知中选择给予任何此类贡献者荣誉或特别感谢。但是，如果您的任何贡献包含在软件中，则它们将成为软件的一部分，并将根据本许可证的条款和条件进行分发。此外，如果您捐赠的投稿被整合到软件中，则Sony Computer Entertainment，Inc.将成为现在包含您投稿的软件的版权所有者，SCEA将成为许可方。\n\n5.以源代码形式重新分发\n\n您可以以源代码形式重新分发软件的副本、修改或衍生版本，前提是您：\n\nA.包括本许可证的副本和任何带有源代码的版权声明\n\nB.确定是否对本软件进行了任何修改\n\nC.包括软件随附的所有文档以及您所做的修改的副本\n\n6.对象形式的再分配\n\n如果您仅以对象形式(合并到成品中，即最终用户应用程序)重新分发软件的副本、修改或衍生版本S)，则您没有义务包括代码、本许可证、版权声明、其他归属或文档的任何副本。\n\n7.不提供担保\n\n本软件按原样提供，没有任何明示或暗示的任何形式的陈述或保证，包括但不限于对所有权、不侵权、适销性或对特定目的的适用性的任何保证。您单独负责确定使用、修改或再分发软件的适当性，并承担与您根据本许可证行使权限相关的任何风险。\n\n8.法律责任的限制\n\n在任何情况下，在任何法律理论下，任何一方都不对另一方或任何第三方承担任何直接、间接、后果性、特殊、偶然性或惩罚性损害赔偿责任，这些损害、损失或损害与本函件协议项下或与之相关的任何伤害、损失或损害，无论是可预见的还是不可预见的，即使该方已被告知此类伤害、损失或损害的可能性。本节规定的责任限制应在法律或任何政府法规允许的最大范围内适用。\n\n9.适用法律和对管辖权的同意\n\n本协定受加利福尼亚州和美利坚合众国的法律管辖和解释，加利福尼亚州的法律不包括与法律选择有关的法律体系。为执行本协议条款或裁决本协议项下产生的任何争议而提起的任何诉讼或程序应在加利福尼亚州圣马特奥县高级法院或加利福尼亚州北区的美国地区法院提起。各方特此同意接受此类法院的专属管辖权和地点，以进行任何此类诉讼。此外，各方特此放弃在与本协议有关的任何诉讼或程序中接受陪审团审判的权利。\n\n10.版权源代码重新分发的通知\n\n版权所有2005年索尼计算机娱乐公司。\n\n根据SCEA共享源代码许可证1.0版(“许可证”)获得许可；除非遵守许可证，否则您不能使用此文件。您可以通过以下地址获取许可证副本：\nHttp://research.scea.com/scea_shared_source_license.html\n\n除非适用法律要求或书面同意，否则根据许可证分发的软件将按原样分发，不提供任何明示或默示的担保或条件。请参阅许可证下管理权限和限制的特定语言的许可证。', NULL);
INSERT INTO `license` VALUES (401, '2023-05-11 23:28:24', 'HPND', 'Historical Permission Notice and Disclaimer', 'https://opensource.org/licenses/HPND', 0, 0, 1, 1, NULL, '<<beginOptional>> Historical Permission Notice and Disclaimer<<endOptional>> <<var;name=\"copyright\";original=\"<copyright notice>\";match=\".{0,1000}\">>\n\nPermission to use, copy, modify and distribute this software and its documentation for any purpose and without fee is hereby granted, provided that the above copyright notice appear in all copies<<beginOptional>>, <<endOptional>><<beginOptional>> and<<endOptional>> that both<<beginOptional>> that<<endOptional>><<beginOptional>> the<<endOptional>> copyright notice and this permission notice appear in supporting documentation<<beginOptional>> , and that the name<<beginOptional>> of<<endOptional>> <<var;name=\"copyrightHolder0\";original=\"<copyright holder>\";match=\".*\">> <<var;name=\"orRelated\";original=\"<or related entities>\";match=\".*\">> not be used in advertising or publicity pertaining to distribution of the software without specific, written prior permission<<endOptional>> .<<beginOptional>> <<var;name=\"copyrightHolder1\";original=\"<copyright holder>\";match=\".*\">> makes no representations about the suitability of this software for any purpose. It is provided \"as is\" without express or implied warranty.<<endOptional>><<beginOptional>> <<var;name=\"copyrightHolder2\";original=\"<copyright holder>\";match=\".*\">> DISCLAIMS ALL WARRANTIES WITH REGARD TO THIS SOFTWARE, INCLUDING ALL IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS <<var;name=\"period\";original=\".\";match=\"[.,]?\">> IN NO EVENT SHALL <<var;name=\"copyrightHolder3\";original=\"<copyright holder>\";match=\".*\">> BE LIABLE FOR ANY SPECIAL, INDIRECT OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES OR ANY DAMAGES WHATSOEVER RESULTING FROM LOSS OF USE, DATA OR PROFITS, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, NEGLIGENCE OR OTHER TORTIOUS ACTION, ARISING OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE USE OR PERFORMANCE OF THIS SOFTWARE.<<endOptional>>', 'Historical Permission Notice and Disclaimer\n\n<copyright notice>\n\nPermission to use, copy, modify and distribute this software and its documentation for any purpose and without fee is hereby granted, provided that the above copyright notice appear in all copies, and that both that the copyright notice and this permission notice appear in supporting documentation, and that the name of <copyright holder> or <related entities> not be used in advertising or publicity pertaining to distribution of the software without specific, written prior permission. <copyright holder> makes no representations about the suitability of this software for any purpose. It is provided \"as is\" without express or implied warranty.\n\n<copyright holder> DISCLAIMS ALL WARRANTIES WITH REGARD TO THIS SOFTWARE, INCLUDING ALL IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS,. IN NO EVENT SHALL <copyright holder> BE LIABLE FOR ANY SPECIAL, INDIRECT OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES OR ANY DAMAGES WHATSOEVER RESULTING FROM LOSS OF USE, DATA OR PROFITS, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, NEGLIGENCE OR OTHER TORTIOUS ACTION, ARISING OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE USE OR PERFORMANCE OF THIS SOFTWARE.', '历史许可声明和免责声明\n\n<版权声明>\n\n特此授予为任何目的免费使用、复制、修改和分发本软件及其文档的许可，前提是上述版权声明出现在所有副本中，并且版权声明和本许可声明均出现在支持文档中，且未经事先明确的书面许可，不得在与分发软件有关的广告或宣传中使用<版权所有者>或<相关实体>的名称。<版权所有者>对本软件是否适用于任何目的不作任何声明。它是按原样提供的，没有明示或默示的保证。\n\n<版权所有者>不对本软件作出任何担保，包括对适销性和适用性的所有默示担保。在任何情况下，<版权所有者>均不对因使用或执行本软件而导致的任何特殊、间接或后果性损害或任何损害负责，无论是在合同诉讼、疏忽或其他侵权行为中。', 'This license has been voluntarily deprecated by its author. Per the copy of this license at http://www.opensource.org/licenses/HPND Explanation: * Angle brackets hold \"fields\", e.g. <copyright holder>. * Square brackets hold optional text, e.g. [or <related entities>]. * A license can have variations in capitalization and whitespace, and still be considered an instance of this template. It may be possible to construct a grammatically incorrect license from this template, or one that lacks a disclaimer, or one that includes a double-disclaimer. That is acceptable, as long as it remains impossible to construct a non-OSD-compliant license that matches the pattern.');
