t use this file except in compliance with the License. Please obtain a copy of the License at http://www.apple.com/publicsource and read it before using this file.\n\nThe Original Code and all software distributed under the License are distributed on an \'AS IS\' basis, WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, AND APPLE HEREBY DISCLAIMS ALL SUCH WARRANTIES, INCLUDING WITHOUT LIMITATION, ANY WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE OR NON-INFRINGEMENT. Please see the License for the specific language governing rights and limitations under the License.\"', '苹果公共源代码许可证\n版本1.0-1999年3月16日\n\n下载本软件之前，请仔细阅读本许可证。下载和使用本软件，即表示您同意受本许可证条款的约束。如果您不同意或不能同意本许可证的条款，请不要下载或使用本软件。\n\n1.总则；定义。本许可证适用于Apple Computer，Inc.(“Apple”)公开宣布受本Apple公共源代码许可证约束的任何程序或其他作品，该程序或作品包含由Apple发出的将该程序或作品标识为“原始代码”的通知，并声明该程序或作品受本Apple公共源代码许可证1.0版(或其后续版本)的条款约束，Apple可能会不时对其进行修订(“许可证”)。如本许可证中所用：\n\n1.1“适用专利”是指：(A)在苹果是权利授予人的情况下，(I)现在或以后由苹果获得、拥有或转让的专利或专利申请，以及(Ii)其权利主张涵盖原始代码中所包含的标的，但仅限于在不侵权的情况下使用、复制和/或分发原始代码所必需的范围；和(B)在您是权利授予人的情况下，(I)现在或以后由您获得、拥有或转让给您的专利和专利申请，以及(Ii)其权利要求涵盖您的修改中的主题，单独或与原始代码结合。\n\n1.2“所涵盖的代码”是指原始代码、修改、原始代码和任何修改的组合，和/或其任何单独部分。\n\n1.3“部署”是指在您的内部研发(R&D)之外使用、再许可或分发所涵盖的代码，包括但不限于您的企业或组织内部对所涵盖的代码的任何和所有内部使用或分发(研发使用除外)，以及您将所涵盖的代码直接或间接再许可或分发给任何第三方以任何形式或方式聚会。\n\n1.4“较大的作品”是指将所涵盖的代码或其部分与不受本许可证条款管辖的代码相结合的作品。\n\n1.5“修改”是指对所涵盖的代码的实质和/或结构进行的任何添加、删除和/或更改。当代码作为一系列文件发布时，修改是：(A)对包含所涵盖代码的文件的内容进行任何添加或删除；和/或(B)包含所涵盖代码的任何部分的任何新文件或计算机程序语句的其他表示。\n\n1.6“原始代码”是指Apple根据本许可证最初提供的程序或其他作品的源代码，包括Apple根据本许可证提供的此类程序或作品的任何更新或升级的源代码，并且Apple已在此类作品的头文件(S)中明确标识为此类程序或作品的源代码。\n\n1.7“源代码”是指程序或适合于对其进行修改的其他作品的人类可读形式，包括其包含的所有模块，以及任何相关的接口定义文件、用于控制可执行文件(目标代码)的编译和安装的脚本。\n\n1.8“您”或“您的”是指在本许可证项下行使权利的个人或法人。对于法人实体，“您”或“您的”包括控制您、受您控制或与您处于共同控制之下的任何实体，其中“控制”是指(A)通过合同或其他方式直接或间接地指挥或管理该实体，或(B)拥有该实体50%(50%)或以上的流通股或实益所有权。\n\n2.准许用途；条件及限制在遵守本许可证的条款和条件的前提下，Apple特此授予您在您接受本许可证并下载原始代码之日起，在Apple的适用专利和版权涵盖原始代码，以执行以下操作：\n\n2.1您可以使用、复制、修改和分发原始代码，无论是否修改，仅用于您的内部研究和开发，但您必须在每个情况下：\n\n(A)在原始代码的所有副本中保留和复制Apple在原始代码中出现的版权和其他所有权声明和免责声明，并保持原始代码中涉及本许可证的所有声明完好无损；\n\n(B)将本许可证的副本包括在您分发的每份所涵盖代码和文档的源代码副本中，并且您不得在此类源代码上提供或强加任何条款来更改或限制本许可证或接受者在本许可证下的权利，除非第6条允许；以及\n\n(C)完整、准确地记录您所做的所有修改和每次此类修改的日期，指定您使用的原始代码的版本，突出显示包含此类信息的文件和修改，并在源代码的每个文件中复制附件A中有关所有此类修改的通知。\n\n2.2您可以部署所涵盖的代码，但您必须在每个实例中：\n\n(A)满足关于所涵盖代码的源代码的第2.1节的所有条件；\n\n(B)根据本许可证的条款，通过电子分发(例如，从网站下载)以源代码的形式公开提供您部署的所有修改，并遵守以下第3节所述的许可授予以及您可以根据第6节选择提供的任何附加条款。只要您部署了所涵盖的代码或自初始部署之日起十二(12)个月(以较长的时间为准)，您必须继续提供您部署的修改的源代码；\n\n(C)必须通知Apple和其他第三方如何通过填写和提交有关所需信息，请访问http://www.apple.com/publicsource/modifications.html；和\n\n(D)如果您以目标代码(仅限可执行形式)部署所涵盖的代码，则应在代码本身以及相关文档中包含一个显著的通知，说明根据本许可证的条款可以获得所涵盖的代码的源代码，以及获取此类源代码的方式和位置的信息。\n\n3.你的奖助金。作为对根据本许可证授予您的许可证的考虑和条件：\n\n(A)您特此授予Apple和所有第三方在您的适用专利和您拥有或控制的其他知识产权下的非排他性、免版税许可，以使用、复制、修改、分发和部署您的修改，其范围和程度与Apple根据第2.1和2.2条的许可相同；和\n\n(B)您特此向Apple及其子公司授予非排他性、全球性、免版税、永久且不可撤销的许可，根据您拥有或控制的适用专利和其他知识产权，您可以通过多层分销以任何形式使用、复制、执行、编译、显示、执行、修改或修改(针对Apple和/或其子公司)、再许可和分发您的修改。\n\n4.更大的作品。您可以通过将所涵盖的代码与不受本许可证条款管辖的其他代码相结合来创建较大的作品，并将较大的作品作为单个产品分发。在每个此类情况下，您必须确保所涵盖代码或其任何部分满足本许可证的要求。\n\n5.专利许可的限制。除第2节明文规定外，Apple未在此授予任何其他明示或默示的专利权。修改和/或更大的作品可能需要苹果公司的额外专利许可，苹果公司可能会自行决定授予这些许可。\n\n6.附加条款。您可以选择提供并收取保修、支持、向所涵盖代码的一个或多个接收者提供与本许可证范围一致的赔偿或责任义务和/或其他权利(“附加条款”)。但是，您这样做只能代表您自己，并作为您的唯一责任，而不是代表苹果公司。您必须征得收件人的同意，同意任何此类附加条款是由您单独提供的，并且您在此同意就任何此类附加条款所引起的任何责任或针对Apple提出的任何索赔，对Apple进行赔偿、辩护并使Apple不受损害。\n\n7.许可证的版本。Apple可能会不时发布本许可证的修订版本和/或新版本。每个版本都会有一个不同的版本号。在本许可证的特定版本下发布原始代码后，您可以根据该版本的条款继续使用它。您也可以选择在Apple发布的本许可证的任何后续版本的条款下使用此类原始代码。除Apple外，其他任何人都无权修改适用于根据本许可证创建的所涵盖代码的条款。\n\n8.不提供保修或支持。原始代码可能包含全部或部分预发布、未经测试或未完全测试的作品。原始代码可能包含可能导致数据失败或丢失的错误，并且可能不完整或包含不准确之处。您明确承认并同意使用原始代码或其任何部分由您独自承担全部风险。原始代码按“原样”提供，不提供任何形式的保证、升级或支持，Apple和Apple的许可人(S)(在第8和9节中，Apple和Apple的许可人(S)统称为“Apple”)明确不承担任何明示或默示的保证和/或条件，包括但不限于对适销性或对特定用途的质量和适用性满意以及不侵犯第三方权利的默示保证和/或条件。苹果不会开战保证原始代码中包含的函数将满足您的要求，或者原始代码的操作将不会中断或没有错误，或者原始代码中的缺陷将被更正。Apple或Apple授权代表提供的任何口头或书面信息或建议均不得创建保修或以任何方式扩大本保修的范围。您承认，原始代码不用于核设施、飞机导航、通信系统或空中交通管制机器的操作，在这种情况下，原始代码的失效可能导致死亡、人身伤害或严重的人身或环境破坏。\n\n9.法律责任。\n\n9.1侵权。如果任何原始代码成为侵权索赔的标的(“受影响的原始代码”)，Apple可自行酌情选择：(A)尝试获取您继续使用受影响的原始代码所需的权利；(B)修改受影响的原始代码，使其不再侵权；或(C)终止您使用受影响的原始代码的权利，自Apple在用于实施本许可证的Apple网站上张贴此类通知后立即生效。\n\n9.2责任限制。在任何情况下，Apple都不对因本许可证或您使用或无法使用原始代码或其任何部分而引起或与之相关的任何附带、特殊、间接或后果性损害负责，无论是根据合同、保修、侵权(包括疏忽)、产品责任或其他理论，即使Apple已被告知此类损害的可能性，即使任何补救措施的基本目的失败。在任何情况下，苹果对您在本许可证下的所有损害赔偿的总责任不得超过50美元(50美元)。\n\n10.商标。本许可证不授予使用商标或商品名称“Apple”、“Appl”不得使用“e Computer”、“Mac OS X”、“Mac OS X Server”或任何其他属于Apple的商标或商品名称(统称为“Apple商标”)，不得使用Apple商标来支持或促销源自原始代码的产品\n除非得到苹果第三方商标使用指南的许可并始终严格遵守该指南，该指南发布在http://www.apple.com/legal/guidelinesfor3rdparties.html.\n\n11.所有权。Apple保留原始代码以及由Apple或代表Apple所做的任何修改(“Apple修改”)的所有权利、所有权和权益，并且此类Apple修改不会自动受本许可证的约束。Apple可自行决定根据本许可证或根据与本许可证中包含的条款不同的条款授权此类Apple修改，也可以选择根本不授权。Apple对所涵盖代码的开发、使用、复制、修改、再许可和分发不受本许可证的约束。\n\n12.终止。\n\n12.1终止。本许可证和根据本许可证授予的权利将终止：\n\n(A)如果您未能遵守本许可证的任何条款(S)，并且未在意识到此类违规行为的30天内纠正此类违规行为，则无需苹果公司的通知即可自动生效；\n\n(B)如属第9.1及/或13.6(B)条所述的情况，则立即作出；或\n\n(C)如果您在本许可证期限内的任何时间开始对Apple提起专利侵权诉讼，则无需Apple的通知即可自动执行。\n\n12.2终止的效力。终止后，您同意立即停止对所涵盖的代码或受影响的原始代码的任何进一步使用、复制、修改和分发，如果根据第9.1条终止，则销毁所涵盖的代码或受影响的原始代码的所有副本(在\n根据第9.1条终止)由您拥有或控制的。对所涵盖代码的所有子许可在本许可证终止前已正式授予的许可证在本许可证终止后仍然有效。根据其性质，在本许可证终止后应继续有效的条款将继续有效，包括但不限于第3、5、8、9、10、11、12.2和13条。任何一方都不会仅因根据其条款终止本许可证而对另一方承担任何类型的赔偿、赔偿或损害责任，本许可证的终止不会损害任何一方的任何其他权利或补救措施。\n\n13.杂项。\n\n13.1出口法保证。您不得使用或以其他方式出口或再出口原始代码，除非得到美国法律和获得原始代码的司法管辖区法律的授权。特别是，但不限于，原始代码不得出口或再出口(A)到任何美国禁运国家(或其国民或居民)，或(B)出口到美国财政部特别指定国民名单或美国商务部拒绝命令表上的任何人。通过使用原始代码，您声明并保证您不在任何此类国家或任何此类名单上，或不在任何此类国家或地区的国民或居民的控制之下。\n\n13.2政府最终用户。所涵盖的代码是FAR 2.101中定义的“商业项目”。所涵盖代码中的政府软件和技术数据权利仅包括本许可证中定义的那些通常提供给公众的权利。技术数据和软件的惯常商业许可在\n根据FAR 252.227-12.211(技术数据--商业项目)和227.7202-3(商业计算机软件或计算机软件文档的权利)，对于国防部采购，符合FAR 12.211(技术数据)和12.212(计算机软件)。因此，所有美国政府最终用户获得的所涵盖代码仅具有此处规定的那些权利。\n\n13.3的关系派对。本许可证不会被解释为在您和Apple之间建立代理、合作伙伴关系、合资企业或任何其他形式的法律联系，并且您不会以明示、暗示、外观或其他方式表示相反的意见。\n\n13.4自主发展。本许可证中的任何内容都不会损害Apple获取、许可、开发、让其他人为其开发、营销和/或分发与您可能开发、生产、营销或分发的修改、较大作品、技术或产品执行相同或类似功能或与之竞争的技术或产品的权利。\n\n13.5豁免；建造。Apple未能执行本许可证的任何条款将不被视为放弃该条款或任何其他条款的未来执行。任何规定合同语言应被解释为对起草人不利的法律或法规将不适用于本许可证。\n\n13.6可分割性。(A)如果有管辖权的法院出于任何原因认定本许可证的任何条款或其部分不可执行，则应在允许的最大程度上执行许可证的该条款，以实现各方的经济利益和意图，本许可证的其余部分将继续完全有效。(B)尽管有上述规定，但如果适用法律禁止或限制您完全和/或明确遵守第2和/或3节，或阻止其中任何一节的可执行性，本许可证将立即终止，您必须立即停止使用所涵盖的代码，并销毁您所拥有或控制的所有副本。\n\n13.7争议解决。您和Apple之间与本许可证有关的任何诉讼或其他争议解决方案应在加利福尼亚州北区进行，并且您和Apple特此同意在加利福尼亚州和加利福尼亚州的州法院和联邦法院的个人管辖权和地点与本许可证有关的T区。《联合国国际货物销售合同公约》的适用被明确排除在外。\n\n13.8整个协议；适用法律。本许可证构成双方之间关于本协议标的的完整协议。本许可证应受美国和加利福尼亚州的法律管辖，但与法律冲突有关的加利福尼亚州法律除外。\n\n在您所在的加拿大魁北克省，以下条款适用：双方特此确认，他们已要求以英文起草本许可证和所有相关文件。当事各方不能出示与之相反的单据。\n\n证据A。\n\n“部分版权所有(C)1999 Apple Computer，Inc.保留所有权利。此文件包含原始代码和/或原始代码的修改，如中所定义，并受Apple公共源代码许可证版本1.0(‘许可证’)的约束。除非遵守许可证，否则您不能使用此文件。请从http://www.apple.com/publicsource获取许可证的副本，并在使用此文件之前阅读。\n\n原始代码和根据许可证分发的所有软件都是按原样分发的，没有任何明示或默示的担保，Apple特此拒绝所有此类担保，包括但不限于对适销性、特定用途适用性或不侵权的任何担保。请参阅许可证下管理权利和限制的特定语言的许可证。“', 'This license was released 16 March 1999.');
INSERT INTO `license` VALUES (404, '2023-05-11 23:28:24', 'BSD-2-Clause', 'BSD 2-Clause \"Simplified\" License', 'https://opensource.org/licenses/BSD-2-Clause', 0, 0, 1, 0, NULL, '<<var;name=\"copyright\";original=\"Copyright (c) <year> <owner>. All rights reserved.\";match=\".{0,1000}\">>\n\nRedistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without modification, are permitted provided that the following conditions are met:\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"1.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Redistributions of source code must retain the above copyright notice, this list of conditions and the following disclaimer.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"2.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Redistributions in binary form must reproduce the above copyright notice, this list of conditions and the following disclaimer in the documentation and/or other materials provided with the distribution.\n\nTHIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED BY <<var;name=\"copyrightHolderAsIs\";original=\"THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS AND CONTRIBUTORS\";match=\".+\">> \"AS IS\" AND ANY <<var;name=\"express\";original=\"EXPRESS\";match=\"EXPRESS(ED)?\">> OR IMPLIED WARRANTIES, INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, THE IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE ARE DISCLAIMED. IN NO EVENT SHALL <<var;name=\"copyrightHolderLiability\";original=\"THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER OR CONTRIBUTORS\";match=\".+\">> BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES (INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, PROCUREMENT OF SUBSTITUTE GOODS OR SERVICES; LOSS OF USE, DATA, OR PROFITS; OR BUSINESS INTERRUPTION) HOWEVER CAUSED AND ON ANY THEORY OF LIABILITY, WHETHER IN CONTRACT, STRICT LIABILITY, OR TORT (INCLUDING NEGLIGENCE OR OTHERWISE) ARISING IN ANY WAY OUT OF THE USE OF THIS SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.', 'Copyright (c) <year> <owner> All rights reserved.\n\nRedistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without modification, are permitted provided that the following conditions are met:\n\n1. Redistributions of source code must retain the above copyright notice, this list of conditions and the following disclaimer.\n\n2. Redistributions in binary form must reproduce the above copyright notice, this list of conditions and the following disclaimer in the documentation and/or other materials provided with the distribution.\n\nTHIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED BY THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS AND CONTRIBUTORS \"AS IS\" AND ANY EXPRESS OR IMPLIED WARRANTIES, INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, THE IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE ARE DISCLAIMED. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER OR CONTRIBUTORS BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES (INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, PROCUREMENT OF SUBSTITUTE GOODS OR SERVICES; LOSS OF USE, DATA, OR PROFITS; OR BUSINESS INTERRUPTION) HOWEVER CAUSED AND ON ANY THEORY OF LIABILITY, WHETHER IN CONTRACT, STRICT LIABILITY, OR TORT (INCLUDING NEGLIGENCE OR OTHERWISE) ARISING IN ANY WAY OUT OF THE USE OF THIS SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.', '版权所有(C)<年份><所有者>保留所有权利。\n\n在满足以下条件的情况下，允许以源代码和二进制形式重新分发和使用，无论是否进行修改：\n\n1.源代码的再分发必须保留上述版权声明、此条件列表和以下免责声明。\n\n2.二进制形式的再分发必须在随分发提供的文档和/或其他材料中复制上述版权声明、此条件列表和以下免责声明。\n\n本软件由版权所有者和贡献者按原样提供，任何明示或默示担保，包括但不限于对适销性和特定用途适用性的默示担保，均予以否认。在任何情况下，版权所有者或贡献者均不对因使用本软件而造成的任何直接、间接、附带、特殊、惩罚性或后果性损害(包括但不限于购买替代产品或服务；失去使用、数据或利润；或业务中断)承担任何责任，即使被告知此类损害的可能性已被告知，无论是合同责任、严格责任或侵权(包括疏忽或其他)。', NULL);
INSERT INTO `license` VALUES (405, '2023-05-11 23:28:24', 'MITNFA', 'MIT +no-false-attribs license', 'https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Licensing/MITNFA', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 'Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\nThe above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\nDistributions of all or part of the Software intended to be used by the recipients as they would use the unmodified Software, containing modifications that substantially alter, remove, or disable functionality of the Software, outside of the documented configuration mechanisms provided by the Software, shall be modified such that the Original Author\'s bug reporting email addresses and urls are either replaced with the contact information of the parties responsible for the changes, or removed entirely.\n\nTHE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.', 'Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\nThe above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\nDistributions of all or part of the Software intended to be used by the recipients as they would use the unmodified Software, containing modifications that substantially alter, remove, or disable functionality of the Software, outside of the documented configuration mechanisms provided by the Software, shall be modified such that the Original Author\'s bug reporting email addresses and urls are either replaced with the contact information of the parties responsible for the changes, or removed entirely.\n\nTHE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.', '特此免费授予任何获得本软件副本和相关文档文件(下称“软件”)的人不受限制地处理本软件的权利，包括但不限于使用、复制、修改、合并、发布、分发、再许可和/或销售本软件副本的权利，以及允许获得本软件的人员这样做的权利，但须满足下列条件：\n\n上述版权声明和本许可声明应包含在软件的所有副本或主要部分中。\n\n本软件的全部或部分分发应由接收者使用，就像他们将使用未修改的软件一样，其中包含大幅更改、删除或禁用软件功能的修改，在本软件提供的文档配置机制之外，应对其进行修改，以便将原始作者的错误报告电子邮件地址和URL替换为负责更改的各方的联系信息，或完全删除。\n\n该软件是“按原样”提供的，没有任何形式的明示或默示保证，包括但不限于适销性、适合某一特定用途和不侵权的保证。在任何情况下，作者或版权所有者对因软件或软件的使用或其他交易而引起、产生或与之相关的任何索赔、损害赔偿或其他责任，无论是在合同、侵权或其他诉讼中，均不承担任何责任。', NULL);
INSERT INTO `license` VALUES (406, '2023-05-11 23:28:24', 'W3C-20150513', 'W3C Software Notice and Document License (2015-05-13)', 'https://www.w3.org/Consortium/Legal/2015/copyright-software-and-document', 0, 0, 0, 0, '[$name_of_software: $distribution_URI] Copyright (c) [$date-of-software] World Wide Web Consortium, (Massachusetts Institute of Technology, European Research Consortium for Informatics and Mathematics, Keio University, Beihang). All Rights Reserved. This work is distributed under the W3C® Software License [1] in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. [1] http://www.w3.org/Consortium/Legal/copyright-software', 'This work is being provided by the copyright holders under the following license.\n\nLicense\n\nBy obtaining and/or copying this work, you (the licensee) agree that you have read, understood, and will comply with the following terms and conditions.\n\nPermission to copy, modify, and distribute this work, with or without modification, for any purpose and without fee or royalty is hereby granted, provided that you include the following on ALL copies of the work or portions thereof, including modifications:\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"•\";match=\".{0,20}\">> The full text of this NOTICE in a location viewable to users of the redistributed or derivative work.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"•\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Any pre-existing intellectual property disclaimers, notices, or terms and conditions. If none exist, the W3C Software and Document Short Notice should be included.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"•\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Notice of any changes or modifications, through a copyright statement on the new code or document such as \"This software or document includes material copied from or derived from [title and URI of the W3C document]. Copyright (c) [YEAR] W3C® (MIT, ERCIM, Keio, Beihang).\"\n\nDisclaimers\n\nTHIS WORK IS PROVIDED \"AS IS,\" AND COPYRIGHT HOLDERS MAKE NO REPRESENTATIONS OR WARRANTIES, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO, WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY OR FITNESS FOR ANY PARTICULAR PURPOSE OR THAT THE USE OF THE SOFTWARE OR DOCUMENT WILL NOT INFRINGE ANY THIRD PARTY PATENTS, COPYRIGHTS, TRADEMARKS OR OTHER RIGHTS.\n\nCOPYRIGHT HOLDERS WILL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, SPECIAL OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES ARISING OUT OF ANY USE OF THE SOFTWARE OR DOCUMENT.\n\nThe name and trademarks of copyright holders may NOT be used in advertising or publicity pertaining to the work without specific, written prior permission. Title to copyright in this work will at all times remain with copyright holders.', 'This work is being provided by the copyright holders under the following license.\n\nLicense\nBy obtaining and/or copying this work, you (the licensee) agree that you have read, understood, and will comply with the following terms and conditions.\n\nPermission to copy, modify, and distribute this work, with or without modification, for any purpose and without fee or royalty is hereby granted, provided that you include the following on ALL copies of the work or portions thereof, including modifications:\n\n     • The full text of this NOTICE in a location viewable to users of the redistributed or derivative work.\n     • Any pre-existing intellectual property disclaimers, notices, or terms and conditions. If none exist, the W3C Software and Document Short Notice should be included.\n     • Notice of any changes or modifications, through a copyright statement on the new code or document such as \"This software or document includes material copied from or derived from [title and URI of the W3C document]. Copyright (c) [YEAR] W3C® (MIT, ERCIM, Keio, Beihang).\"\n\nDisclaimers\nTHIS WORK IS PROVIDED \"AS IS,\" AND COPYRIGHT HOLDERS MAKE NO REPRESENTATIONS OR WARRANTIES, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO, WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY OR FITNESS FOR ANY PARTICULAR PURPOSE OR THAT THE USE OF THE SOFTWARE OR DOCUMENT WILL NOT INFRINGE ANY THIRD PARTY PATENTS, COPYRIGHTS, TRADEMARKS OR OTHER RIGHTS.\n\nCOPYRIGHT HOLDERS WILL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, SPECIAL OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES ARISING OUT OF ANY USE OF THE SOFTWARE OR DOCUMENT.\n\nThe name and trademarks of copyright holders may NOT be used in advertising or publicity pertaining to the work without specific, written prior permission. Title to copyright in this work will at all times remain with copyright holders.', '本作品由版权持有者根据以下许可提供。\n\n许可证\n通过获取和/或复制本作品，您(被许可人)同意您已阅读、理解并将遵守以下条款和条件。\n\n特此授予为任何目的复制、修改和分发本作品的许可，无论是否进行修改，并且不收取任何费用或版税，前提是您在作品或其部分的所有副本上包括以下内容，包括修改：\n\n·将本通知的全文放在重新发布或衍生作品的用户可以查看的位置。\n·任何先前存在的知识产权免责声明、通知或条款和条件。如果不存在，则应包括W3C软件和文档的简短通知。\n·任何更改或修改的通知，通过新代码或文件上的版权声明，如“本软件或文件包括从[W3C文件的标题和URI]复制或派生的材料。版权所有(C)[年]W3C®(麻省理工学院、欧洲信息通信技术中心、庆应义乌、北航)。”\n\n免责声明\n本作品按原样提供，版权所有者不作任何明示或暗示的陈述或担保，包括但不限于对适销性或适用于任何特定目的的担保，或对软件或文档的使用不会侵犯任何第三方专利、版权、商标或其他权利的担保。\n\n版权所有者不对因使用软件或文档而造成的任何直接、间接、特殊或后果性损害承担责任。\n\n未经事先书面许可，不得在与作品有关的广告或宣传中使用著作权人的名称和商标。本作品的版权所有权始终归版权所有者所有。', 'This license takes effect 13 May, 2015.This version makes clear that the license is applicable to both software and text, by changing the name and substituting \"work\" for instances of \"software and its documentation.\" It moves \"notice of changes or modifications to the files\" to the copyright notice, to make clear that the license is compatible with other liberal licenses.');
INSERT INTO `license` VALUES (407, '2023-05-11 23:28:24', 'Barr', 'Barr License', 'https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Licensing/Barr', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 'This is a package of commutative diagram macros built on top of Xy-pic by Michael Barr (email: barr@barrs.org). Its use is unrestricted. It may be freely distributed, unchanged, for non-commercial or commercial use. If changed, it must be renamed. Inclusion in a commercial software package is also permitted, but I would appreciate receiving a free copy for my personal examination and use. There are no guarantees that this package is good for anything. I have tested it with LaTeX 2e, LaTeX 2.09 and Plain TeX. Although I know of no reason it will not work with AMSTeX, I have not tested it.', 'This is a package of commutative diagram macros built on top of Xy-pic  by Michael Barr (email: barr@barrs.org). Its use is unrestricted. It  may be freely distributed, unchanged, for non-commercial or commercial  use. If changed, it must be renamed. Inclusion in a commercial  software package is also permitted, but I would appreciate receiving a  free copy for my personal examination and use. There are no guarantees  that this package is good for anything. I have tested it with LaTeX 2e,  LaTeX 2.09 and Plain TeX. Although I know of no reason it will not work  with AMSTeX, I have not tested it.', '这是一个基于Michael Barr(电子邮件：barr@barrs.org)的XY-pic构建的交换图宏包。它的使用不受限制。它可以免费分发，不变，用于非商业或商业用途。如果更改，则必须重命名。包含在商业软件包中也是允许的，但我希望收到一份供我个人检查和使用的免费副本。不能保证这个方案对任何事情都有好处。我已经用LaTeX 2E、LaTeX 2.09和Plain Tex进行了测试。虽然我知道它没有理由不能与AMSTeX一起工作，但我还没有测试过它。', NULL);
INSERT INTO `license` VALUES (408, '2023-05-11 23:28:24', 'EUDatagrid', 'EU DataGrid Software License', 'http://eu-datagrid.web.cern.ch/eu-datagrid/license.html,https://opensource.org/licenses/EUDatagrid', 0, 0, 1, 1, NULL, '<<beginOptional>> EU DataGrid Software License<<endOptional>> <<var;name=\"copyright\";original=\"Copyright (c) 2001 EU DataGrid. All rights reserved.\";match=\".{0,1000}\">>\n\nThis software includes voluntary contributions made to the EU DataGrid. For more information on the EU DataGrid, please see http://www.eu-datagrid.org/.\n\nInstallation, use, reproduction, display, modification and redistribution of this software, with or without modification, in source and binary forms, are permitted. Any exercise of rights under this license by you or your sub-licensees is subject to the following conditions:\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"1.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Redistributions of this software, with or without modification, must reproduce the above copyright notice and the above license statement as well as this list of conditions, in the software, the user documentation and any other materials provided with the software.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"2.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> The user documentation, if any, included with a redistribution, must include the following notice:\n\n   \"This product includes software developed by the EU DataGrid (http://www.eu-datagrid.org/).\"\n\n   Alternatively, if that is where third-party acknowledgments normally appear, this acknowledgment must be reproduced in the software itself.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"3.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> The names \"EDG\", \"EDG Toolkit\", \"EU DataGrid\" and \"EU DataGrid Project\" may not be used to endorse or promote software, or products derived therefrom, except with prior written permission by hep-project-grid-edg-license@cern.ch.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"4.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> You are under no obligation to provide anyone with any bug fixes, patches, upgrades or other modifications, enhancements or derivatives of the features, functionality or performance of this software that you may develop. However, if you publish or distribute your modifications, enhancements or derivative works without contemporaneously requiring users to enter into a separate written license agreement, then you are deemed to have granted participants in the EU DataGrid a worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free, perpetual license to install, use, reproduce, display, modify, redistribute and sub-license your modifications, enhancements or derivative works, whether in binary or source code form, under the license conditions stated in this list of conditions.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"5.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> DISCLAIMER\n\n   THIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED BY THE EU DATAGRID AND CONTRIBUTORS \"AS IS\" AND ANY EXPRESS OR IMPLIED WARRANTIES, INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, THE IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, OF SATISFACTORY QUALITY, AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE OR USE ARE DISCLAIMED. THE EU DATAGRID AND CONTRIBUTORS MAKE NO REPRESENTATION THAT THE SOFTWARE, MODIFICATIONS, ENHANCEMENTS OR DERIVATIVE WORKS THEREOF, WILL NOT INFRINGE ANY PATENT, COPYRIGHT, TRADE SECRET OR OTHER PROPRIETARY RIGHT.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"6.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> LIMITATION OF LIABILITY\n\nTHE EU DATAGRID AND CONTRIBUTORS SHALL HAVE NO LIABILITY TO LICENSEE OR OTHER PERSONS FOR DIRECT, INDIRECT, SPECIAL, INCIDENTAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES OF ANY CHARACTER INCLUDING, WITHOUT LIMITATION, PROCUREMENT OF SUBSTITUTE GOODS OR SERVICES, LOSS OF USE, DATA OR PROFITS, OR BUSINESS INTERRUPTION, HOWEVER CAUSED AND ON ANY THEORY OF CONTRACT, WARRANTY, TORT (INCLUDING NEGLIGENCE), PRODUCT LIABILITY OR OTHERWISE, ARISING IN ANY WAY OUT OF THE USE OF THIS SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES.', 'EU DataGrid Software License\n\nCopyright (c) 2001 EU DataGrid. All rights reserved.\n\nThis software includes voluntary contributions made to the EU DataGrid. For more information on the EU DataGrid, please see http://www.eu-datagrid.org/.\n\nInstallation, use, reproduction, display, modification and redistribution of this software, with or without modification, in source and binary forms, are permitted. Any exercise of rights under this license by you or your sub-licensees is subject to the following conditions:\n\n1. Redistributions of this software, with or without modification, must reproduce the above copyright notice and the above license statement as well as this list of conditions, in the software, the user documentation and any other materials provided with the software.\n\n2. The user documentation, if any, included with a redistribution, must include the following notice:\n   \"This product includes software developed by the EU DataGrid (http://www.eu-datagrid.org/).\"\n\nAlternatively, if that is where third-party acknowledgments normally appear, this acknowledgment must be reproduced in the software itself.\n\n3. The names \"EDG\", \"EDG Toolkit\", “EU DataGrid” and \"EU DataGrid Project\" may not be used to endorse or promote software, or products derived therefrom, except with prior written permission by hep-project-grid-edg-license@cern.ch.\n\n4. You are under no obligation to provide anyone with any bug fixes, patches, upgrades or other modifications, enhancements or derivatives of the features,functionality or performance of this software that you may develop. However, if you publish or distribute your modifications, enhancements or derivative works without contemporaneously requiring users to enter into a separate written license agreement, then you are deemed to have granted participants in the EU DataGrid a worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free, perpetual license to install, use, reproduce, display, modify, redistribute and sub-license your modifications, enhancements or derivative works, whether in binary or source code form, under the license conditions stated in this list of conditions.\n\n5. DISCLAIMER\nTHIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED BY THE EU DATAGRID AND CONTRIBUTORS \"AS IS\" AND ANY EXPRESS OR IMPLIED WARRANTIES, INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, THE IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, OF SATISFACTORY QUALITY, AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE OR USE ARE DISCLAIMED. THE EU DATAGRID AND CONTRIBUTORS MAKE NO REPRESENTATION THAT THE SOFTWARE, MODIFICATIONS, ENHANCEMENTS OR DERIVATIVE WORKS THEREOF, WILL NOT INFRINGE ANY PATENT, COPYRIGHT, TRADE SECRET OR OTHER PROPRIETARY RIGHT.\n\n6. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY\nTHE EU DATAGRID AND CONTRIBUTORS SHALL HAVE NO LIABILITY TO LICENSEE OR OTHER PERSONS FOR DIRECT, INDIRECT, SPECIAL, INCIDENTAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES OF ANY CHARACTER INCLUDING, WITHOUT LIMITATION, PROCUREMENT OF SUBSTITUTE GOODS OR SERVICES, LOSS OF USE, DATA OR PROFITS, OR BUSINESS INTERRUPTION, HOWEVER CAUSED AND ON ANY THEORY OF CONTRACT, WARRANTY, TORT (INCLUDING NEGLIGENCE), PRODUCT LIABILITY OR OTHERWISE, ARISING IN ANY WAY OUT OF THE USE OF THIS SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES.', '欧盟数据网格软件许可证\n\n版权所有(C)2001 EU DataGrid。版权所有。\n\n该软件包括向欧盟数据网格提供的自愿捐款。有关欧盟数据网格的更多信息，请访问http://www.eu-datagrid.org/.\n\n允许以源代码和二进制形式安装、使用、复制、显示、修改和再分发本软件，无论是否进行修改。您或您的子被许可人在本许可证项下行使的任何权利均受以下条件约束：\n\n1.本软件的再分发，无论是否经过修改，都必须在本软件、用户文档和随本软件提供的任何其他材料中复制上述版权声明和上述许可声明以及此条件列表。\n\n2.再分发中包含的用户文档(如果有)必须包括以下声明：\n“本产品包括由欧盟数据网格(http://www.eu-datagrid.org/).”)开发的软件\n\n或者，如果这是第三方确认通常出现的地方，则该确认必须在软件本身中重现。\n\n3.“EDG”、“EDG工具包”、“EU DataGrid”和“EU DataGrid Project”等名称不得用于认可或推广软件或由此衍生的产品，除非事先获得hep-project-grid-edg-license@cern.ch的书面许可。\n\n4.您没有义务向任何人提供您可能开发的本软件的特性、功能或性能的任何错误修复、补丁、升级或其他修改、增强或衍生。但是，如果您发布或分发您的修改、增强或衍生作品，而不同时要求用户签订单独的书面许可协议，则您被视为已向EU DataGrid的参与者授予了安装、使用、复制、显示、修改、再分发和子许可您的修改、增强的全球、非排他性、免版税、永久许可或衍生作品，无论是二进制形式还是源代码形式，在此条件列表中所述的许可条件下。\n\n5.免责声明\n本软件由欧盟DATAGRID和投稿人按原样提供，任何明示或默示保证，包括但不限于对适销性、质量令人满意以及适合特定用途或用途的默示保证，均不予承认。欧盟DATAGRID和贡献者不表示软件、修改、增强或其衍生作品不会侵犯任何专利、版权、商业秘密或其他专有权利。\n\n6.法律责任的限制\n对于因使用本软件而产生的任何性质的直接、间接、特殊、附带、后果性、惩罚性或惩罚性损害，包括但不限于因任何原因造成的替代商品或服务的采购、使用损失、数据或利润或业务中断，以及任何合同、保修、侵权(包括疏忽)、产品责任或其他理论，欧盟数据和贡献者不对被许可方或其他人承担责任，即使被告知此类损害的可能性也是如此。', NULL);
INSERT INTO `license` VALUES (409, '2023-05-11 23:28:24', 'ADSL', 'Amazon Digital Services License', 'https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Licensing/AmazonDigitalServicesLicense', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 'This software code is made available \"AS IS\" without warranties of any kind. You may copy, display, modify and redistribute the software code either by itself or as incorporated into your code; provided that you do not remove any proprietary notices. Your use of this software code is at your own risk and you waive any claim against Amazon Digital Services, Inc. or its affiliates with respect to your use of this software code. (c) 2006 Amazon Digital Services, Inc. or its affiliates.', 'This software code is made available \"AS IS\" without warranties of any kind. You may copy, display, modify and redistribute the software code either by itself or as incorporated into your code; provided that you do not remove any proprietary notices. Your use of this software code is at your own risk and you waive any claim against Amazon Digital Services, Inc. or its affiliates with respect to your use of this software code. (c) 2006 Amazon Digital Services, Inc. or its affiliates.', '本软件代码按原样提供，不提供任何形式的担保。您可以自行复制、显示、修改和重新分发软件代码，也可以将其合并到您的代码中；前提是您不能删除任何专有声明。您使用此软件代码的风险自负，并且您放弃就您使用此软件代码向Amazon Digital Services，Inc.或其附属公司提出的任何索赔。(C)2006年亚马逊数字服务公司或其附属公司。', NULL);
INSERT INTO `license` VALUES (410, '2023-05-11 23:28:24', 'Qhull', 'Qhull License', 'https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Licensing/Qhull', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, '<<var;name=\"copyright\";original=\"Qhull, Copyright (c) 1993-2003\n\nThe National Science and Technology Research Center for Computation and Visualization of Geometric Structures (The Geometry Center) University of Minnesota\";match=\".{0,1000}\">>\n\nemail: qhull@qhull.org\n\nThis software includes Qhull from The Geometry Center. Qhull is copyrighted as noted above. Qhull is free software and may be obtained via http from www.qhull.org. It may be freely copied, modified, and redistributed under the following conditions:\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"1.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> All copyright notices must remain intact in all files.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"2.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> A copy of this text file must be distributed along with any copies of Qhull that you redistribute; this includes copies that you have modified, or copies of programs or other software products that include Qhull.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"3.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> If you modify Qhull, you must include a notice giving the name of the person performing the modification, the date of modification, and the reason for such modification.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"4.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> When distributing modified versions of Qhull, or other software products that include Qhull, you must provide notice that the original source code may be obtained as noted above.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"5.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> There is no warranty or other guarantee of fitness for Qhull, it is provided solely \"as is\". Bug reports or fixes may be sent to qhull_bug@qhull.org; the authors may or may not act on them as they desire.', 'Qhull, Copyright (c) 1993-2003\n\nThe National Science and Technology Research Center for Computation and Visualization of Geometric Structures (The Geometry Center) University of Minnesota\n\nemail: qhull@qhull.org\n\nThis software includes Qhull from The Geometry Center. Qhull is copyrighted as noted above. Qhull is free software and may be obtained via http from www.qhull.org. It may be freely copied, modified, and redistributed under the following conditions:\n\n1. All copyright notices must remain intact in all files.\n\n2. A copy of this text file must be distributed along with any copies of Qhull that you redistribute; this includes copies that you have modified, or copies of programs or other software products that include Qhull.\n\n3. If you modify Qhull, you must include a notice giving the name of the person performing the modification, the date of modification, and the reason for such modification.\n\n4. When distributing modified versions of Qhull, or other software products that include Qhull, you must provide notice that the original source code may be obtained as noted above.\n\n5. There is no warranty or other guarantee of fitness for Qhull, it is provided solely \"as is\". Bug reports or fixes may be sent to qhull_bug@qhull.org; the authors may or may not act on them as they desire.', 'Qhull，版权所有(C)1993-2003\n\n明尼苏达大学几何结构计算与可视化国家科学技术研究中心(几何中心)\n\n电子邮件：qhull@qhull.org\n\n该软件包括几何中心的Qhull。如上所述，Qhull拥有版权。Qhull是免费软件，可以通过http从www.qhull.org获得。在下列情况下，可以自由复制、修改和重新分发：\n\n1.所有文件中的所有版权声明必须保持不变。\n\n2.此文本文件的副本必须与您重新分发的Qhull的任何副本一起分发；这包括您已修改的副本，或包含Qhull的程序或其他软件产品的副本。\n\n3.如果你修改Qhull，你必须附上一份通知，说明进行修改的人的姓名、修改日期和修改原因。\n\n4.在分发Qhull的修改版本或包含Qhull的其他软件产品时，您必须注意可能会如上所述获取原始源代码。\n\n5.对QHUL的适合性不作任何保证或其他保证，仅按原样提供。错误报告或修复程序可以发送到qhull_bug@qhull.org；作者可能会也可能不会按他们的意愿行事。', NULL);
